    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Detached three bedroom farm cottage.\r\nExtending to approximately 140 sq. m (1,506 sq. ft).\r\nOff street parking to the front.\r\nOil fired central heating.\r\nConvenient location near Waterford City, University Hospital Waterford, and the coastal town of Tramore.\r\nVacant possession.\r\n\r\nBidx1 are delighted to bring to the property market Auguste, Ballindud, Co. Waterford, a beautifully upgraded period home on the edge of Waterford City Location Auguste,  A Home Steeped in History: Originally built as a traditional farm cottage in the mid-1800s and extended in the early 1900s, Auguste now spans approximately 140 square meters. Recently modernised, the home has been transformed into a stylish and comfortable residence while preserving its unique period character.\r\nBallindud is ideally positioned in a countryside setting but is also just minutes from urban convenience. Auguste is ideally located approximately  5 km from Waterford City Centre, 5 km from University Hospital Waterford and less than 8 km from the seaside town of Tramore. This is a rare opportunity to experience peaceful rural living with quick access to city amenities, schools, transport links, and the coast.\r\nVacant possession."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "The property was not internally inspected or measured by BidX1. The information was provided by the Vendor. We are informed that the property provides:Accommodation:Entrance Porch 4.04m x 1.97m (13'3\" x 6'6\")Living Room 5.76m x 4.67m (18'11\" x 15'4\")Conservatory 7.98m x 1.67m (26'2\" x 5'6\")Utility Room 3.18m x 1.51m (10'5\" x 4'11\")Kitchen 3.77m x 5.79m (12'4\" x 19')Pantry 1.27m x 1.48m (4'2\" x 4'10\")Bedroom 1 3.23m x 2.61m (10'7\" x 8'7\")Bedroom 2 3.52m x 3.26m (11'7\" x 10'8\")Hallway 3.22m x .92m (10'7\" x .301'10\")Bedroom 3 3.79m x 3.18m (12'5\" x 10'5\")Bathroom 2.73m x 2.24m (8'11\" x 7'4\")Garage 2.88m x 5.76m (9'5\" x 18'11\")Other features include: Private gardens, resting on c. 0.25 acre site, garage, off road parking for several cars."
